OL,3,ABritish woman killed in stabbing at
OL,4,AGerman railway station
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British woman has died after being
OL,7,Fstabbed at a railway station in
OL,8,Fsouthern Germany in the early hours of
OL,9,FSunday morning, police have said.
OL,11,FThe 31-year-old woman was attacked at
OL,12,Fthe station in Rosenheim, Bavaria,
OL,13,Fshortly before 01:00 local time
OL,14,F(00:00BST). She was taken to hospital
OL,15,Fwhere she died as a result of "severe"
OL,16,Finjuries, the Bavarian Police said in a
OL,17,Fstatement.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
