OL,3,AIceland votes against restarting talks
OL,4,Aon joining EU
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, debate in this island nation
OL,7,Fof almost 400,000 people centred more
OL,8,Fon its fishing industry rather than
OL,9,Fsecurity concerns.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
