OL,3,AManhunt after shooting at Swiss rave
OL,4,Akills woman, 22, and injures five
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police spokesperson told Swiss media
OL,7,Fon Sunday afternoon that they had "no
OL,8,Fconcrete leads", having earlier said
OL,9,Fthe shooter's identity and motives were
OL,10,Funclear.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
