OL,3,ALarge Lake Ontario sign installed in
OL,4,ACanada in latest jab at US
OL,5,
OL,6,FOntario Premier Doug Ford has hit back
OL,7,Fat Donald Trump by installing a large
OL,8,Fsign on Canada's shoreline with the
OL,9,Fmessage: "Lake Ontario. Now and
OL,10,FAlways."
OL,12,FThe US president signed an executive
OL,13,Forder on Thursday seeking to change its
OL,14,Fname to Lake America and has shared a
OL,15,Fseries of AI-generated videos about the
OL,16,Flake that straddles both countries.
OL,18,F"Long before President Trump, this lake
OL,19,Fwas called Lake Ontario. Long after
OL,20,FPresident Trump is gone, it will still
OL,21,Fbe called Lake Ontario," Ford said.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
